  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cambodia Agricultural Value Chain Program Phase 2 (CAVAC 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cambodia Agricultural Value Chain (CAVAC) Phase 2 aims to reduce rural poverty by improving the productivity and incomes of smallholder farmers in Cambodia. CAVAC Phase 2 will continue the market-based approach of Phase 1, and take into consideration the changing agricultural systems and priorities of the Cambodian Government. The program goal is to promote a commercially viable, resilient agriculture sector supporting inclusive growth with profitable irrigated agriculture and a competitive and diversified agriculture industry.</narrative>
  </description>
